6. musictoptrackapi [GET] /musictoptrackapi/{startdate}/{starttime}/{enddate}/{endtime}

    This API will return top 50 songs that are played during a time period every one hour.

    Example calling:

        api_url = "http://localhost:9090/musictoptrack/2025-05-07/12:00:00/2025-05-09/14:00:00"
    
        response = requests.get(api_url)

        if response.status_code == 200:
            data = response.json().get('Data', [])
            if data:
                print(data)
            else:
                print("No data returned by the API.")
        else:
            print(f"Error: {response.status_code} - {response.text}")

